# Executable acquisition manifest for scripts/dataset-estate-refresh.sh
#
# pipe-separated columns:
# lane|id|kind|relative_path|url_or_repo|ref|expected_bytes|sha256|md5
#
# This file contains only artifacts that are safe to automate without click-through
# terms. `git` rows are archived into deterministic gzip snapshots; mutable active
# worktrees are never used as the admitted artifact. `url` rows download atomically
# into /vault/Data/.refresh-20260903 (or LAPLACE_DATA_REFRESH_ROOT).
#
# Large Wikipedia/Wikidata/Syzygy acquisition is intentionally implemented as named
# workers in the shell script rather than pretending a recursive estate is one URL row.

